<title>SWEDEN: FORECAST - Swedish trade union LO economic forecasts.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Swedish trade union LO economic forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Trade Union Federation (LO) on Thursday released its forecasts for the Swedish economy.</p>
<p>					1996	    1997</p>
<p> Gross Domestic Product	  1.6	     2.1</p>
<p> Private consumption	     1.5	     1.9</p>
<p> Public consumption	     -2.7	    -1.2</p>
<p> Investments			 9.7	     2.4</p>
<p> Inventory investment	   -1.4	     0.7</p>
<p> Export				5.8	     6.0</p>
<p> Import				2.5	     6.6</p>
<p> Consumer Price Index	    0.7	     1.7</p>
<p> Industrial production	   2.4	     3.8</p>
<p>Total unemployment</p>
<p>   (incl gov't schemes)	 12.2	    11.9</p>
<p> Unemployment			7.9	     7.4</p>
<p> Hourly wage			 6.1	     4.3</p>
<p> Trade balance (bln SKR)	45.0	    45.7</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
